
# Throwaway probe arms. e2e/probe-witness.mts, e2e/probe-witness-positive.mts
# and e2e/revocation-reaches-mint.e2e.ts re-mint these on every run, and a swap
# consumes what it is given, so a fresh arm is a single-use proof that must
# never be committed.
#
# They used to be written straight into this directory and ignored by name,
# which hid the 2026-09-07 captures the unit tests read. Every clean clone then
# failed 30 tests with ENOENT. The probes now write here instead, and the
# captures the tests read are tracked (see README.md).
probe-out/
